---
name: badge
type: registry:ui
title: Badge
description: A small label for status, counts, or categories.
dependencies:
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/badge/badge.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/badge/badge.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/badge/badge.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/badge/badge.variants.ts"
  - path: registry/items/components/badge/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/badge/index.ts"
---

This site uses `Badge` to label each item's registry `type` on its doc page.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Badge } from "~/components/badge";
</script>

<Badge>Default</Badge>
<Badge variant="secondary">Secondary</Badge>
<Badge variant="outline">Outline</Badge>
```
